    "account.benefit.checkout" : {
      "comment" : "Third account benefit in the list on the Konto tab (signed-out state), next to a lightning icon: with an account, checkout is faster. Short phrase in the same style as the other two benefits, max ~30 characters. Glossary: Zur Kasse (EN checkout).",
